      "subject": "General Aptitude",
      "marks": 2,
      "question": "Consider a string P of length 𝑙 that is laid out as a straight-line segment. Another string K is laid out as a semicircular arc with string P as its diameter, as represented in Figure (i). When both the strings are shortened by a length 𝑥 they can be re-arranged such that the shortened string K forms a full circle with the shortened string P as its diameter, as represented in Figure (ii). The value of 𝑥/𝑙 is __________",
